WEBVTT

00:15:59.083 --> 00:16:02.268
Druga Troja, irska Troja.

00:16:02.292 --> 00:16:04.976
Bliža ponirućem suncu.

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.851
Neosvojena.

00:16:06.875 --> 00:16:10.101
Kad biste mogli čuti ovu pesmu,

00:16:10.125 --> 00:16:13.226
i vi biste slušali u zanosu

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:15.434
mná caointe,

00:16:15.458 --> 00:16:17.768
tužbalicu žena koje zapomažu,

00:16:17.792 --> 00:16:19.768
tuguju, užasnutih srca

00:16:19.792 --> 00:16:23.059
u večnom horu bdenja,

00:16:23.083 --> 00:16:27.893
gde poslednja najbolja nada
čovečanstva još živi.

00:16:27.917 --> 00:16:31.268
Da smrtnik otelotvoren u mesu